Description:It is your first main phase. You control Phalanx Leader (1/1, heroic: put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control) and Grizzly Bears, and have Gods Willing in hand with one white mana floating. The opponent is at 5 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
